   "text": "Springfield Warrior Sports is the ideal venue for a birthday party in Springfiel",
   "full": "Springfield Warrior Sports is the ideal venue for a birthday party in Springfield, MO. With a variety of party options facilitated by our crew and a full hour of gym time, adults can relax knowing everything is taken care of while the kids have fun! Parties here are extraordinary - not only do we promise that kids will love it, but we also make sure the birthday boy or girl has something special too; the week after their party, the birthday kid gets to come to a ninja class for free and their very own Ninja t-shirt!",
