   "text": "At Springfield Warrior Sports, we want to take the stress out of your party plan",
   "full": "At Springfield Warrior Sports, we want to take the stress out of your party planning - schedule your birthday party with us, and let us do the rest — including cleanup! Each party lasts for a total of 1.5 hours. Included in the party is one hour of gym time, featuring open play and an obstacle course set up and facilitated by our Crew. Approximately 30 minutes can be used for cake, presents, and pizza! (optional). The birthday child will receive a Springfield Warrior Sports T-shirt, and the week after their party, they get to try a ninja class for free.",
